  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven equation: 164 − 173 ÷ 110 + 140 × 5 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after '+' and '−' are interchanged and '×' and '÷' are interchanged:\n\n164 − 173 ÷ 110 + 140 × 5 = ? ⇒ 164 + 173 × 110 - 140 ÷ 5 = ?\n\n⇒ 164 + 173 × 110 - __**140 **____**÷**____** 5**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 164 + __**173 **____**×**____** 110**__ - 28 = ?\n\n⇒ __164____ + 19030__ - 28 = ?\n\n⇒ __19194____ - 28__ = ?\n\n⇒ 19166 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
